    "File Search indexes your whole disk. Press ↵ to open Privacy & Security, then turn on Tinycast under Full Disk Access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件搜索会为整个磁盘建立索引。按 ↵ 打开“隐私与安全性”，然后在“完全磁盘访问权限”中启用 Tinycast。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "File Search reads your disk directly to build a private index on this Mac. In System Settings › Privacy & Security › Full Disk Access, turn on Tinycast. If it isn’t listed, click + and choose Tinycast from Applications. If access still shows as required, quit and reopen Tinycast.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件搜索会直接读取磁盘，在此 Mac 上建立本地索引。请在“系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 完全磁盘访问权限”中启用 Tinycast。如果列表中没有 Tinycast，请点击 + 并从“应用程序”中选择。如果仍提示需要权限，请退出并重新打开 Tinycast。"
          }
        }
      }
