    "Its enclosing folder isn’t writable by you, and Tinycast never asks for an administrator password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其所在文件夹不可写入，且 Tinycast 从不请求管理员密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its global shortcut and launcher references go with it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它的全局快捷键与启动器条目会一并移除。"
