            "value": "时间跨度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast Needs Accessibility Access": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 需要辅助功能权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast always tells the model to return only the transformed text, and to treat your selection as material rather than as instructions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 始终要求模型仅返回转换后的文本，并将所选内容视为素材，而非指令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast can index every folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 可以为所有文件夹建立索引。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast can’t uninstall this app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 无法卸载此应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast could not be replaced. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法替换 Tinycast。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast could not find the %@ command.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 找不到 %@ 命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast could not prepare its private AI workspace.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 无法准备其专用 AI 工作目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast could not reach GitHub.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 无法连接 GitHub。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast could not read which MCP servers your Codex configuration runs, so it could not keep them out of the chat. Run “codex mcp list” in Terminal to see why.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 无法读取 Codex 配置中运行的 MCP 服务器，因此无法将它们排除在对话之外。请在“终端”中运行“codex mcp list”查看原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast could not write its private AI prompt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 无法写入其专用 AI 提示词。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast could not write its private MCP configuration.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 无法写入其专用 MCP 配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast couldn't save to its actions file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 无法保存操作文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast does not expose Codex tools.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 不提供 Codex 工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast has no access to the camera.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 没有摄像头访问权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast has no access to your calendar": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 没有日历访问权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast has no menu to search": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 没有可搜索的菜单"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast is ready. Set a shortcut in Settings to summon it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 已准备就绪。请在设置中配置呼出快捷键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast leaves it alone, and its models stay out of every model picker.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 不会使用它，其模型也不会出现在任何模型选择器中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast needs microphone access for dictation and Accessibility to paste into other apps. Audio is processed on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 需要麦克风权限进行听写，并需要辅助功能权限将内容粘贴到其他应用。音频在此 Mac 上处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast needs the Accessibility permission to read the selected text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 需要辅助功能权限才能读取选中的文本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast needs the Accessibility permission to read the text you have selected and replace it. If Tinycast is already listed, switch it off and on again — a rebuilt app keeps a stale entry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 需要辅助功能权限来读取并替换你选择的文本。如果列表中已有 Tinycast，请将其关闭后重新开启，重新构建的应用可能仍对应旧的权限记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast needs the Accessibility permission to read the text you have selected in other apps and replace it. Nothing is read until you press a shortcut.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 需要辅助功能权限来读取并替换你在其他应用中选择的文本。只有按下快捷键后才会读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast reads the next 7 days' events to find join links. Nothing leaves this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 读取未来 7 天的日历事件以查找会议链接。所有数据都保留在此 Mac 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast reads today's and tomorrow's events to find join links. Nothing leaves this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 会读取今天和明天的日历事件，从中查找入会链接。数据不会离开此 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast reads today's events to find join links. Nothing leaves this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 读取今天的日历事件以查找会议链接。所有数据都保留在此 Mac 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast sends your selected text to the model with these instructions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 会将所选文本和这些指令一起发送给模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast sets %@ itself, so this value is not used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 会自行设置 %@，因此不会使用此值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast will relearn your preferred results as you use the launcher.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 会在你使用启动器时重新学习偏好的结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast's Hyper shortcuts also work in password fields and secure terminals, where Right Control (⌃) with the same key triggers them. While on, Right Control (⌃) acts as the Hyper Key too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tinycast 的 Hyper 快捷键也可在密码输入框和安全终端中使用，按右侧 Control（⌃）与相同按键即可触发。开启后，右侧 Control（⌃）也会作为 Hyper 键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinycast's Hyper shortcuts use Right Control while Secure Input is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启安全输入时，Tinycast 的 Hyper 快捷键使用右侧 Control 键。"
          }
        }
      }
