    "Your Codex MCP server “%@” cannot be kept out of a Tinycast chat, because a dot or an equals sign in its name cannot be addressed. Rename it in your Codex configuration.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法将 Codex MCP 服务器“%@”排除在 Tinycast 对话之外，因为其名称中的句点或等号无法用于指定服务器。请在 Codex 配置中重命名它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Codex configuration has its own MCP server named “%@”. Rename it to use this Tinycast server with Codex.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex 配置中已有名为“%@”的 MCP 服务器。请将其重命名，以便在 Codex 中使用此 Tinycast 服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
